      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.42 (up from ₹0.41 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹83.3m (up 157% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹10.2m (up 2.5% from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 12% (down from 31% in 3Q 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 4% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 189% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
